      "id": 245242,
      "name": "",
      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-31T02:51:54.611Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This week, it’s Advanced Chokepoint listening to all the metal throughout the Time Cataclysm while Malpractice Medico, Harpy, PW Tempest, and Luminary try to dull her luster!</p>\n<p>Luckily for this team, there are only three unique Equipment cards in all their decks, so not a lot of things for Chokepoint to corrupt/destroy. She doesn’t really have a good way to get rid of Ongoings, other than flipping them over. If you get Medico with his Experimental Medicine and Healing Pulse, play Regeneration, then use Red Right Hand power you can wreck her in a few rounds. Tempest with his Cleansing Downpour can make it happen that much faster. There were tons of cards from all decks face down in her area, but it didn’t really matter much by that point.</p>\n<p>Advanced seems much more manageable than Challenge Mode. Overall a rather easy Mint, IMO. Helps to have a stellar team with basically no weakness to the villain.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6\" title=\"20220530223850_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20220530223850_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"kporYLgIWmOQ76KzQ1imASfuqOy\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/8/8f0a5963e2ead581c111b8dfb49f36c8e65aabe6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20220530223850_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 450 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
