      "id": 245244,
      "name": "KateWalker",
      "username": "TakeWalker",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-31T12:39:05.796Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This was ultimately an easy Mint, but what a tedious game! It just seemed like everyone’s best cards were buried way, way down in their decks. I spent a lot of Tempest’s and even Dr. Medico’s turns double-skipping to try and find something better. And of course, flipped Chokepoint stealing the first card Luminary discarded with each use of his power was super annoying.</p>\n<p>But like you said, Red Right Hand saved the day. I took her out the turn I got Cleansing Downpour in play.</p>",
