      "created_at": "2022-05-31T13:21:59.250Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I think I had 20+ cards down in her area. It’s annoying, but not crippling. At least the effect isn’t cumulative! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/flushed.png?v=12\" title=\":flushed:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":flushed:\"> Luminary never even got to use a Doomsday Device because I think they all got flipped down. Anyway, Medico dealing irreducible damage was all that was needed to pierce her armor.</p>",
