    {
      "id": 245248,
      "name": "doppelgangerung",
      "username": "doppelgangerung",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-05-31T17:26:33.387Z",
      "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9\" title=\"Screenshot_20220531-121015\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20220531-121015\" data-base62-sha1=\"3sD9UtTfmU6k1jQq9MLgGIIb569\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/1/1843125e487b1d75086d4b529dbb1c1ed0bbbff9_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20220531-121015</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 202 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nUgly Mint, due to some sloppy plays and failure to pick up some of the cards that might have smoothed things out.</p>\n<p>Luminary never got to call in a Doomsday device, as too many of the discards he needed got sucked into orbit around his opponent, but his Sabre Battle Drones got a few solid hits in. The Harpy and Tempest fared a bit better, as their one-shots whittled away at her - until Medico combined RRH, Regeneration, and Experimental Medicine in the final round to ensure victory, with the last blow landing at the end of Chokepoint’s own turn!</p>",
